          "text": "Description: Recent testimony (on 19/12/2011) of an old observation on July 14, 2009 around 1:30 AM: Through a roof window, a person long observes the random movement of a spherical phenomenon with a white color and very bright in the sky. No particular noise is heard by the witness. No other testimony will be collected. Of average strangeness but of insufficient consistency (summary description, only one witness), this observation case is difficult to conclude. This case is classified \"C\" for lack of information.",
